      "message": "It\u0027s probably fine, but maybe we could keep it and simplify it a bit with something like:\n\n```c++\nbool cannotInjectError \u003d /*...*/;\nif (!cannotInjectError) {\n    // New helper for `INJECT_ERROR_OR_RUN(VK_SUCCESS, __VA_ARGS__)`\n    MAYBE_INJECT_ERROR(VK_ERROR_DEVICE_LOST);\n    \n}\n\nreturn VkResult::WrapUnsafe(device-\u003efn.WaitForFences(vkDevice, 1, \u0026*waitFence, true,\n                            static_cast\u003cuint64_t\u003e(timeout)));\n```",
